  "description": "VOODOO NAKISI\n\nThe Voodoo Nakisi is designed to take you on an adventure. Being equally capable on and off-road, the Nakisi alloy frame and alloy fork include mudguard and rack mounts to be your companion on your bikepacking adventures, as well as on your daily commuting trips.\n\nWhile traveling on backroads, reliability is king. That is why we have chosen a 2x Shimano drivetrain combined with cable actuated disc brakes. These components not only help to keep the bike simple and affordable, but also easily fixed in case something goes wrong while you are out there with the sole companion of mother nature.\n\nThe Voodoo Nakisi is designed to take you on an adventure. Will it be a multi-day bikepacking trip, the daily commute, or… why not both?",
